The '''Ray of Helios''' is a {{Legendary}} item rarely dropped from [[Harvest Feast]] crops. It is used to craft the [[Sun's Grasp]].

== Obtaining ==
A '''Ray of Helios''' has a {{Chance|0.0000002%|1|500,000,000|crops broken}}<ref>Confirmed by MotorGorilla : https://discord.com/channels/720585022624628797/751480380632334457/1499086996700925952</ref> chance to be obtained from harvesting in-season crops during the [[Harvest Feast]].

{{Stat|bloom}} can be used to increase the chance of finding '''Ray of Helios'''.

A '''Ray of Helios''' could also be obtained as a {{Red|'''MAJOR'''}} reward from the [[Raffle of the Century]].

