== Trivia ==
* The reasoning for '''Ray of Helios'''{{'}}s incredibly low drop chance and the reason why the {{Item|Sun's Grasp}} is not present in the [[Museum]] is outlined by {{RN|h|MotorGorilla}}<ref>https://discord.com/channels/720585022624628797/751480380632334457/1499091111573065931</ref> : 
<blockquote>[…] Pretty much everything rare in the game is now tied to an RNG Meter or Pity which largely takes away a lot of the surprise of dropping something super rare. Everything being tied to SB XP also makes people feel like they need to get something. […] The idea here was to make an item that not everyone will be able to get that is not needed for progression that still does something kinda cool white{{sic}} not being all that good. […] <br> It's entirely optional, and it's intended to bring back a little bit of the excitement from super rare drops pre-RNG Meter days.</blockquote>

